      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "Hard to go past AZONTO (1) who continues to race well. Winner here two back over 1350m when she wound up strongly then again hit the line hard here over this trip and just missed. Can go one better. FLOSSING (2) is a nine-year-old having his first try this circuit but is well placed in this class. Not beaten far in open class last time in Hobart and this is much easier. Likewise ALPINE BLAST (4) is a veteran galloper but already has a good record here. Fourth here last time over a sharper trip and best form stacks up. EAGLEFURTHER (3) was a Hobart winner two back then well off best last time. Was vetted and found to have pulled up lame in both back legs. Has since trialled well so worth another chance. SUGOI LEGEND (5) has ability and should measure up.",
